  "text": "DIGEST\n\n\n6 THINGS\n\nThe allay picked up 6 things. Here they are:\n\nNew comment — Metal Pipe Mace\n\"this mace is unreasonably fun. the sound gets me every time\"\n\nHeld for review — Metal Pipe Mace\n\"this mace is unreasonably fun. the sound gets me every time\"\n\nReported comment — Metal Pipe Mace\n\"this mace is unreasonably fun. the sound gets me every time\"\n\nSync failed — Modrinth\n\nSync stale — YouTube\n\nNew comment — Metal Pipe Mace\n\"second one\"\n\nOpen admin http://localhost:3000/admin/comments\n\nThe allay emails you because digest mail is on. Manage in Settings. http://localhost:3000/admin/settings\n— the allay. It waited until there was a pile. Here's the pile.",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><head><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"http://localhost:3000/brand/email/wordmark@2x.png\"/><meta content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"/><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark\"/><meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"dark\"/></head><body bgcolor=\"#0d131b\" style=\"background-color:#0d131b;margin:0;padding:0\"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style=\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0\" data-skip-in-text=\"true\">The allay picked up 6 things.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#0d131b;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:#eef1f6\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#0d131b\" style=\"backgro