yle=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#eef1f6;font-weight:bold\">Held for review</strong> — Metal Pipe Mace<br/><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&quot;this mace is unreasonably fun. the sound gets me every time&quot;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-top:2px solid #2c3a4b;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da9ba\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#eef1f6;font-weight:bold\">Reported comment</strong> — Metal Pipe Mace<br/><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&quot;this mace is unreasonably fun. the sound gets me every time&quot;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-top:2px solid #2c3a4b;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da9ba\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#eef1f6;font-weight:bold\">Sync failed</strong> — Modrinth</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-top:2px solid #2c3a4b;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da9ba\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#eef1f6;font-weight:bold\">Sync stale</strong> — YouTube</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-top:2px solid #2c3a4b;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da9ba\"><p style=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#eef1f6;font-weight:bold\">New comment</strong> — Metal Pipe Mace<br/><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&quot;second one&quot;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table role=\"presentation\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding-top:24px;vertical-align:middle\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#4b45d6\" style=\"background-color:#4b45d6;border:2px solid #4b45d6\"><a href=\"http://localhost:3000/admin/comments\" data-email-button=\"indigo\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;font-family:Impact, &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em\">Open admin</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 28px;border-top:2px solid #2c3a4b;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da9ba\">The allay emails you because digest mail is on.<!-- --> <a href=\"http://localhost:3000/admin/settings\" style=\"color:#8b86f5;text-decoration-line:underline;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px\" target=\"_blank\">Manage in Settings.</a><br/>— the allay. It waited until there was a pile. Here&#x27;s the pile.</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
